('advanced-native-981', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-981-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Instructions went out without a way for volunteers to send back problems before decisions."],"options":["The coordinator had stopped sending instructions and only received questions.","Instructions went out without a way for volunteers to send back problems before decisions.","Volunteers decided the schedule before the coordinator gave any information.","The meetings already included a problem-reporting round before the schedule was fixed."]},"advanced-native-981-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["They needed a way to report practical problems before the schedule was settled.","The meetings had become a one-way street, with instructions but no route for their feedback.","The coordinator was not hearing the difficulties behind the proposed timetable.","They wanted their experience to inform the plan rather than only receiving orders."],"options":["They needed a way to report practical problems before the schedule was settled.","The meetings had become a one-way street, with instructions but no route for their feedback.","The coordinator was not hearing the difficulties behind the proposed timetable.","They wanted their experience to inform the plan rather than only receiving orders."]},"advanced-native-981-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The support has become a one-way street, and I would like us to discuss what we can offer each other."],"options":["The problem is that neither of us has ever asked for help.","The support has become a one-way street, and I would like us to discuss what we can offer each other.","We have already agreed a balanced way to help each other."]},"advanced-native-981-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Both sides must perform identical tasks for exactly the same time."],"options":["There should be some meaningful exchange.","Both sides must perform identical tasks for exactly the same time.","Different roles can still allow responses in both directions."]},"advanced-native-981-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["A longer briefing would still be a one-way street unless volunteers can raise the problems that affect the plan."],"options":["We should hear about problems only after the schedule is fixed, with no time left for revision.","A longer briefing would still be a one-way street unless volunteers can raise the problems that affect the plan.","We should extend the instructions and leave the reporting channel unchanged."]},"advanced-native-981-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Collecting memories should not be a one-way street. A letters column could explain our editorial choices and invite readers to correct the details.","The magazine can avoid becoming a one-way street by responding to contributors and showing how their stories were used. We should also welcome corrections."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-982', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-982-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["It matters alongside learning and cooperation."],"options":["It matters alongside learning and cooperation.","It is the only purpose of the play.","It is irrelevant to planning the performance.","It measures how much rehearsal support each performer received."]},"advanced-native-982-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We want to judge the experience by more than its income alone.","The performers’ learning is another important purpose of the play.","Ticket sales are not the be-all and end-all; learning and cooperation matter too.","The sales figures do not tell us how the new performers were supported."],"options":["We want to judge the experience by more than its income alone.","The performers’ learning is another important purpose of the play.","Ticket sales are not the be-all and end-all; learning and cooperation matter too.","The sales figures do not tell us how the new performers were supported."]},"advanced-native-982-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Convenience is not the be-all and end-all; the role and schedule also need to fit."],"options":["Travel time should be excluded from the decision completely.","Convenience is not the be-all and end-all; the role and schedule also need to fit.","The easiest journey settles the choice before we check the role."]},"advanced-native-982-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The factor has no relevance and should be ignored."],"options":["A factor can be important without being the sole priority.","The factor has no relevance and should be ignored.","Other purposes should also enter the discussion."]},"advanced-native-982-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Sales are not the be-all and end-all, but we still need the records alongside our review of learning."],"options":["We can remove the sales records because another purpose has been identified.","We should use the sales total as our only evidence about rehearsal quality.","Sales are not the be-all and end-all, but we still need the records alongside our review of learning."]},"advanced-native-982-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Price is not the be-all and end-all of the map order. Please send a sample so we can check the lettering and how easily the map folds.","The budget matters, but price should not be the be-all and end-all. We also need a readable map that people can unfold and use easily."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-983', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-983-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Admiration led the group to accept advice without considering its fit."],"options":["The group rejected the author’s advice before hearing any of it.","The author had asked the group to copy her own characters.","The group checked each suggestion and retained only those that suited its story.","Admiration led the group to accept advice without considering its fit."]},"advanced-native-983-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Admiring her work does not settle how we should revise ours.","Her advice may help, but we still need to consider our story’s needs.","We should check which ideas fit our own characters.","We put her on a pedestal and stopped considering whether each suggestion suited the story."],"options":["Admiring her work does not settle how we should revise ours.","Her advice may help, but we still need to consider our story’s needs.","We should check which ideas fit our own characters.","We put her on a pedestal and stopped considering whether each suggestion suited the story."]},"advanced-native-983-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["We should not put him on a pedestal; his new plan still needs a venue and budget check."],"options":["We should not put him on a pedestal; his new plan still needs a venue and budget check.","The old event’s budget has already been adopted for this new plan.","We should reject the new plan solely because he led the earlier event."]},"advanced-native-983-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Praising a specific contribution while still checking the new proposal."],"options":["Praising a specific contribution while still checking the new proposal.","Treating the person as above the criticism applied to others.","Refusing to examine an admired person’s advice because it must be right."]},"advanced-native-983-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We need not put her on a pedestal or dismiss her advice; let us test what fits the story."],"options":["We need not put her on a pedestal or dismiss her advice; let us test what fits the story.","Her suggestions should be set aside because the characters belong to us.","We can accept the next revision without reading it because she wrote it."]},"advanced-native-983-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["My draft put her on a pedestal by listing only the awards. I will include her own account of the failed project and what she changed afterwards.","Rather than put the teacher on a pedestal, the profile can show how she learned from a setback. We should use the experiences she has agreed to discuss."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-984', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-984-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The clubs’ learning role versus treating them as secondary extras."],"options":["A decision to replace every classroom lesson with drama.","A claim that the club had no effect on cooperation.","The clubs’ learning role versus treating them as secondary extras.","The types of food served after rehearsal."]},"advanced-native-984-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["They are not merely side dishes; the clubs develop skills used with different partners.","The activity contributes to learning rather than only filling time after lessons.","Students learn through the shared work of rehearsing together.","Rehearsals give students practice in listening and revising ideas."],"options":["They are not merely side dishes; the clubs develop skills used with different partners.","The activity contributes to learning rather than only filling time after lessons.","Students learn through the shared work of rehearsing together.","Rehearsals give students practice in listening and revising ideas."]},"advanced-native-984-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Translations are not side dishes here; they make participation possible for these residents."],"options":["Translations are not side dishes here; they make participation possible for these residents.","The translated version only changes how the page looks to readers.","The residents have already answered the untranslated version without difficulty."]},"advanced-native-984-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["It must replace the other main elements entirely."],"options":["It must replace the other main elements entirely.","The speaker rejects treating it as an optional minor addition.","An element has a substantive role in the larger activity."]},"advanced-native-984-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The clubs are not merely side dishes, but their contribution can sit alongside other lessons rather than replace them."],"options":["We should remove other lessons because rehearsal now counts as learning.","We can keep calling the club a spare-time extra without reviewing what students learn.","The clubs are not merely side dishes, but their contribution can sit alongside other lessons rather than replace them."]},"advanced-native-984-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Visitor responses should not be side dishes added after the exhibition is finished. We can read them each week and use relevant comments to revise the explanations.","If we stop treating responses as side dishes, we need a routine for reading and answering them. Relevant suggestions can then inform the next version of the display."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-985', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-985-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["A central course activity that informs revision."],"options":["A test completed only after the final version was fixed.","A central course activity that informs revision.","An optional activity outside the course requirements.","A replacement for making any prototype."]},"advanced-native-985-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The course uses observed visitor difficulties to guide revision.","Testing is part of the main course now, not an optional activity after the design work.","The test is built into the process of developing the design.","Each team needs practical evidence before deciding what to change."],"options":["The course uses observed visitor difficulties to guide revision.","Testing is part of the main course now, not an optional activity after the design work.","The test is built into the process of developing the design.","Each team needs practical evidence before deciding what to change."]},"advanced-native-985-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Source notes are part of the main course, not a decorative addition to these stories."],"options":["Source notes are part of the main course, not a decorative addition to these stories.","The notes replace the stories, so no narrative will be printed.","Readers will receive source notes only if there is unused space."]},"advanced-native-985-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The element must occupy the entire programme."],"options":["The speaker does not view it as merely an optional extra.","An element contributes to the core activity.","The element must occupy the entire programme."]},"advanced-native-985-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Testing is part of the main course because it informs revision, so it belongs before the final design is fixed."],"options":["We can move the test after publication and keep the same revision deadline.","We can use only the team’s impressions instead of observing visitors with the prototype.","Testing is part of the main course because it informs revision, so it belongs before the final design is fixed."]},"advanced-native-985-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Following up unanswered questions is part of the main course for our reading group. The second host should record them so they can inform the next book choice.","The question record is part of the main course, not something to do only if time remains after the meeting. It will help both hosts plan what the group reads next."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-986', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-986-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Learning its history and using it for real exchanges."],"options":["Learning its history and using it for real exchanges.","Studying history while avoiding all conversation practice.","Replacing historical study with information about museum buildings.","Preserving the language by restricting it to written display labels."]},"advanced-native-986-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The club aims to connect understanding of the past with present communication.","We want to use what we learn to ask questions and exchange ideas.","We do not want the language to become a museum piece to be admired behind glass.","Historical knowledge matters, but active use matters as well."],"options":["The club aims to connect understanding of the past with present communication.","We want to use what we learn to ask questions and exchange ideas.","We do not want the language to become a museum piece to be admired behind glass.","Historical knowledge matters, but active use matters as well."]},"advanced-native-986-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The script need not remain a museum piece to be admired behind glass; a reading can explore how it sounds today."],"options":["A reading requires us to overwrite the preserved original.","Keeping the original means the group has already tested how an audience understands the dialogue.","The script need not remain a museum piece to be admired behind glass; a reading can explore how it sounds today."]},"advanced-native-986-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Historical preservation has no value and should stop."],"options":["An activity can combine preservation with thoughtful use.","Admiration alone may leave practical use unexplored.","Historical preservation has no value and should stop."]},"advanced-native-986-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We can avoid treating it as a museum piece to be admired behind glass while still learning it