('advanced-native-989', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-989-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["They completed the form-based task correctly but still needed practice using it in conversation."],"options":["The exercise asked only for future plans.","They completed the form-based task correctly but still needed practice using it in conversation.","They left the past-tense spaces empty.","They already spoke about yesterday without any pauses."]},"advanced-native-989-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The learners can complete the written forms but still pause when describing yesterday.","They can fill in the blanks, but they still need to use those forms in conversation.","The written task does not yet show how easily they can tell a story aloud.","We want to connect the accurate written answers with spoken use."],"options":["The learners can complete the written forms but still pause when describing yesterday.","They can fill in the blanks, but they still need to use those forms in conversation.","The written task does not yet show how easily they can tell a story aloud.","We want to connect the accurate written answers with spoken use."]},"advanced-native-989-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["We can fill in the blanks from the receipts we have and mark the remaining dates as unconfirmed."],"options":["We can give every remaining object the date from the first receipt.","The empty spaces show that all the dates have already been checked.","We can fill in the blanks from the receipts we have and mark the remaining dates as unconfirmed."]},"advanced-native-989-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["They can already use the language freely in any conversation."],"options":["They supplied items required by that exercise.","They can already use the language freely in any conversation.","Another task may be needed to examine spontaneous use."]},"advanced-native-989-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["They can fill in the blanks accurately, so let us build on that with a short conversation rather than treating the two tasks as identical."],"options":["They can fill in the blanks accurately, so let us build on that with a short conversation rather than treating the two tasks as identical.","We can use the written score as the result of a conversation we have not held.","We should repeat only the same written page and postpone speaking until the end of the year."]},"advanced-native-989-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Fill in the blanks with the actions you choose for the character. Then explain one choice on the next page using a detail from the story.","You can fill in the blanks before writing your explanation. Choose one action afterwards and show how it fits the character’s situation."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
